  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a Poblaciones Vulnerables a travs del Plan Argentina contra el Hambre en el Marco de la Pandemia de COVID-19</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Vulnerable Populations through the Argentine Plan to Combat Hunger amid the COVID-19 Pandemic.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir a la implementacin del Plan &quot;Argentina contra el Hambre&quot; para garantizar la alimentacin y nutricin de familias en situacin de vulnerabilidad social priorizando la primera infancia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the implementation of the &quot;Argentina Against Hunger&quot; Plan to prioritize early childhood and ensure the feeding and nutrition of families in social vulnerability with young children.</narrative>
  </description>
